# Build context = repo root for the api and worker images. Keep host-only
# build artifacts out so COPY doesn't drag them in (a host .venv breaks
# `uv venv` in the image; libs/operations/target is a large wrong-platform
# Rust build; __pycache__ poisons the image with stale bytecode).

# Python
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Rust
**/target

# Node / frontend
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite

# VCS / IDE / OS
.git
.gitignore
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Tooling / local
.playwright-mcp
.claude
**/*.log
docs
